  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Above Crescent Lake she waits with Fairy Huang Sha and Fairy Fen Meng, standing apart from Gui Wang and Loner Hong Yu. She looks at Crescent Lake while her sisters speak softly and watch the two demonic path immortals with wary gazes. The three are righteous path Gu Immortals who still collaborate for Immortal Gu recipes in Lang Ya blessed land. None of the five attackers holds an Immortal Gu; they use green grape immortal essence while draining the land’s white litchi immortal essence.",
      "chapters": [
        460
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crescent_lake",
        "char_fairy_huang_sha",
        "char_fairy_fen_meng",
        "char_gui_wang",
        "char_loner_hong_yu",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_gu_recipe",
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Gui Wang and Loner Hong Yu speak of going against heaven, she answers that cultivation follows the mandate of heaven: Gu worms are used to study the great Dao and law of the world, and blessed lands are managed to bring blessings and nurture fortune. After more beads are sunk into the land, she speaks for the three sisters and agrees to throw in fifty more beads and see what happens. Inside the blessed land she steps on cloud soil and names it as fertile ground one can walk like real land, far surpassing mortal world soil.",
      "chapters": [
        460
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is a cold looking blue robed immortal. She is beautiful and charming. She has beautiful feet.",
      "chapters": [
        460
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit had shown weakness to draw the five immortals in, confined their rank five Gu, and took their submission. When Fang Yuan spends a refinement chance, the land spirit teleports the five over as support for Gu refinement. Fairy Fen Meng and Fairy Qing Suo, normally close to Fairy Huang Sha like sisters, remain silent when the land spirit offers Fang Yuan leave to play with Huang Sha.",
      "chapters": [
        464
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "capture-at-lang-ya",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan declines that offer, Fairy Qing Suo and Fairy Fen Meng let out a breath, with complex expressions.",
      "chapters": [
        465
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "capture-at-lang-ya",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later sees the three Hua Hai immortals among familiar captive faces held by Lang Ya land spirit.",
      "chapters": [
        744
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wood-path-trade",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_hua_hai_three_immortals"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He counts the three Hua Hai immortals among four Gu Immortal captives left to him and states that they cultivate wood path. He puts the three into a deal that lets Heavenly Lord Bai Zu change bids at an auction; the seller takes the three Hua Hai immortals as wood path immortal apertures useful to cultivation.",
      "chapters": [
        763
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wood-path-trade",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_heavenly_lord_bai_zu"
      ]
    }
  ],
